  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a blender or food processor, combine northern thai chili sauce, orange marmalade, soy sauce, garlic, fish sauce, and brown sugar.",
    "3. Blend sauce until smooth.",
    "4. In a large bowl, whisk together sauce and chicken breast.",
    "5. Thread chicken onto northern skewers.",
